flowchart TD
  P["Benchmark item:<br/>problem + reference"]
  P --> M["Model reply"]
  M --> C["Code: pull out<br/>the code block"]
  M --> A["Math: pull out<br/>the final answer"]
  C --> S["Run hidden tests<br/>in a sandbox"]
  A --> G["Compare with the<br/>reference answer"]
  S --> V["Verdict: pass or fail"]
  G --> V
  S -.-> W1["Misses: bugs the<br/>tests never exercise"]
  G -.-> W2["Misses: right answers<br/>written another way"]
